in amounts suitable to their own tastes. Although a few commercial mixtures do not have it, many cooks consider that Herbes de Provence without lavender is not really Herbes de Provence.\n\nA fairly standard mixture is given here.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Basil|basil]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Marjoram|marjoram]]\n* ½ tbsp [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Savory|summer savory]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Thyme|thyme]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Bay Leaf|bay leaf]], crushed\n* 2–3 [[Cookbook:Lavender|lavender]] flowers, crushed\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Fennel|fennel]] seeds (optional)\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Sage|sage]] (optional)\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Combine all ingredients, and mix until blended.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for spice mixes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fennel seed]]\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using marjoram]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using savory]]\n[[Category:Recipes using thyme]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bay leaf]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sage]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Homemade Herbes de Provence","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 tbsp basil","sourceText":"1 tbsp basil","amountText":"1 tbsp basil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tbsp marjoram","sourceText":"1 tbsp marjoram","amountText":"1 tbsp marjoram","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"½ tbsp rosemary","sourceText":"½ tbsp rosemary","amountText":"½ tbsp rosemary","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tbsp summer savory","sourceText":"1 tbsp summer savory","amountText":"1 tbsp summer savory","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tbsp thyme","sourceText":"1 tbsp thyme","amountText":"1 tbsp thyme","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","nam